# 🕷️ DeepWeb / Tor Onion Keyword Scraper

A Python-based Tor crawler that discovers `.onion` sites, extracts links, and filters pages using keywords.  
It also supports **Ahmia search integration** to automatically discover onion sites.

> ⚠️ This tool is intended for **educational and cybersecurity research purposes only**.  
> Always follow local laws and ethical guidelines when using Tor or dark web resources.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🌐 Tor (SOCKS5) proxy support
- 🔎 Keyword-based page filtering
- 🧠 Ahmia search engine integration (onion discovery)
- 🔁 Recursive crawling of onion links
- 💾 Save results to file
- ⚡ Adjustable crawl speed (delay control)
- 🧪 Tor connection test mode
- 📋 Clean numbered CLI help menu

---

## 📦 Requirements

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install requests[socks] beautifulsoup4 colorama

sudo apt update
sudo apt install tor -y

sudo systemctl start tor

deepweb-scraper/
│
├── deepweb_scraper.py
├── results.txt
└── README.md

python3 deepweb_scraper.py -h

python3 deepweb_scraper.py \
--ahmia cybersecurity \
--keywords privacy security research \
--pages 10

python3 deepweb_scraper.py \
--seed http://example.onion \
--keywords hacking forum security \
--pages 20 \
--output results.txt


python3 deepweb_scraper.py --check-tor


